stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Waiting: Enter a name
  Waiting --> Searching: Name unchanged for 300 ms
  Waiting --> Waiting: Edit the name before 300 ms
  Searching --> Choices: Page succeeds
  Choices --> Searching: Ask for more results
  Searching --> Retry: Page fails, accepted choices stay visible
  Retry --> Searching: Retry the exact failed page
  Searching --> Searching: Repeated retry clicks admit one read
  Retry --> Waiting: Enter another name, retire failed page
  Searching --> Waiting: Enter another name, ignore late page
  Searching --> Contacts: Directory verb unavailable
  Waiting --> Idle: Clear the name
  Choices --> Waiting: Enter another name
  Idle --> Closed: Close editor
  Waiting --> Closed: Close editor
  Searching --> Closed: Close editor, ignore late page
  Choices --> Closed: Close editor
  Retry --> Closed: Close editor
  Contacts --> Closed: Close editor
  Closed --> [*]
  %% never Retry restarts an accepted page.
  %% never Late pages replace the current name's choices.
  %% never Retry removes the selected person or duplicates accepted choices.
